+# Changelog
+
+## 2.4.0
+
+- The client uses version 2 of the directory API. Version 1 goes offline at the end of the quarter.
+- `fetch_page` counts pages from 0, as version 2 does.
+- New `iter_users()` walks all pages.
+- The client honors the Retry-After header of a busy server.
+- The default retry count drops from 5 to 3. The API gateway now retries on its own, so 5 client retries made an outage take minutes to report.
