@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+# directory-sync
+
+Nightly jobs that read the people directory.
+
+| Job | What it does |
+|---|---|
+| `jobs/sync_users.py` | Copies the users into the local accounts table and disables accounts that the directory no longer lists. |
+| `jobs/count_users.py` | Reports the number of users to the license dashboard. |
+
+## Client
+
+`client.DirectoryClient` talks to version 2 of the directory API.
+
+- `fetch_page(page)` reads one page. Pages count from 0.
+- `iter_users()` reads all pages.
+- A busy server (429, 502, 503, 504) gets up to 3 attempts. The client waits as long as Retry-After says, at most 30 s.
